### Register user 1
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "FullName": "John Doe",
    "Email": "johndoe@email.com",
    "Password": "JohnPassword"
}

### Login user 1
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Email": "johndoe@email.com",
    "Password": "JohnPassword"
}

